  "editorialHtmlEn": "<p>Ordering follows Data.ai / We Are Social style global social-app rankings — not endorsement of any product policy.</p><p>MAU figures trail press cycles by months; national-only messengers and tiny niche networks are skipped so this row stays readable. Hot mix below is RSS-fed — titles often stay English at the source.</p><p>Last reviewed: <strong>2026-05-19</strong>. Adult-only or unmoderated communities are excluded from the top row by default.</p><p>Hot mix shows official blog headlines, not a scrape of user timelines.</p>",
